<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 74.6700 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 74.6700 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 74.6700 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 74.9500 on Monday.</p>
